  "text": "def get_odd_collatz(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Given a positive integer n, return a sorted list that has the odd numbers in collatz sequence.\n    \"\"\"\n    collatz = []\n    while n != 1:\n        if n % 2 == 1:\n            collatz.append(n)\n        n = n // 2 if n % 2 == 0 else 3 * n + 1\n    collatz.append(1)\n    return sorted(collatz)",
